"""Build, sign and install unified kernel images (UKIs) for the secure boot path.

Python 3 standard library only. External tools: ukify (systemd-ukify),
sbsign and sbverify (sbsigntools), openssl. Exit status: 0 on success, 1 when
the request is refused (one sentence on stderr), 2 on usage errors.
See secboot/README.md.
"""
